{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile setup using pca_n2000 RNA encoding and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727. The results suggest pca_n2000 may underperform compared to scvi_n200 (0.6501 accuracy) in RNA-only multiprofile settings, but the relative impact of aggregation or other factors remains unclear without direct comparison."
}

